; `quantize` at full strength onto the QUARTER grid: 0.4q moves back to
; 0q, 1.6q forward to 2q and 2.9q forward to 3q. The grid lines are the
; METER's, under the map the document derives, and the tie at exactly
; half a step breaks downwards.
(plan quantize :args (a :sel (s :lanes [flash] :kinds [note]) :grid "1/4" :strength 1))
